is error message comes from the parent's mail client, the edupage server administrator has no control over the team. But mostly it means trouble. Most often, the problem with the team is that the email address is really bad. For example, there is a typo in it. It must be corrected and the report sent again.\r\n\r\np.s. This list only talks about emails. The recipient's edupage account will always receive a message.","15219":"Test code","15220":"Select the fields you want to insert","15221":"Resend email","15222":"Email text","15223":"view mailing list","15224":"without contact","15225":"nothing will be sent","15226":"with EduPage","15227":"EduPage notification will also be sent","15228":"The messages have been sent.","15229":"Number of emails sent","15230":"Unsent \/ problem emails","15231":"Sending messages, please wait, it may take a few minutes","15232":"Are you sure you want to send the message to the following recipients?","15233":"Recipients with an email address will be sent an email. If the recipient also has an EduPage account, they will also be sent an EduPage notification. Recipients without an email address or account are marked in red - it is not possible to send a message to them.","15234":"Resend","15235":"Email preview","15236":"Please enter the email text.","15237":"Message content","15238":"with email","15239":"an email will be sent","15241":"Reaction","15242":"Pending","15243":"Pending responses","15246":"Like added","15247":"Like was cancelled","15248":"Show email replies","15249":"Replies from other recipients","15250":"no answer yet","15251":"they haven't opened the message yet","15252":"message opened","15253":"our school's reaction","15254":"Pending yet","15255":"set as pending","15256":"set as done","15257":"Email not found","15258":"Generate test code","15259":"First, select what to set in bulk.","15260":"Resend message","15261":"Sending the message again is useful if one of the parents has not responded to you for a long time or has not ye